We will build a crypto trading bot that integrates the following technical indicators:

1. Bollinger Bands (BB)


2. Moving Averages (MA 20, 50, 100, 200)


3. Stochastic RSI (Scottish RSI)



This bot will analyze live USDT-based crypto pairs, determine market trends, and generate bullish or bearish signals for potential trades.


